    rdfs:label "On 25 and 26 August 2010 the applicant complained to the Chief Prosecutor that on 19 August 2010, directly before being transferred to Kutaisi Prison no. 2, he had been severely beaten by the governor of Rustavi Prison no. 6 and had sustained serious injuries to his ribs, head and backbone."@en ;
